Can you imagine exploring Tenerife with a totally personalised tour accompanied by an expert guide?&nbsp;&nbsp;

You choose the destinations, the stops and the pace of the tour: do you want to visit the Teide and then discover Masca, or do you prefer a gastronomic tour through local guachinches? It&#39;s up to you.&nbsp;

You will be picked up at the point of your choice, either in the north or south of the island, so you don&#39;t have to worry about anything. In addition, you will have an Official Guide of the Canary Islands Government, something that is not usually included in private tours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Not sure where to start? Some popular routes include:&nbsp;&nbsp;
Vilaflor, Corona Forestal Natural Park, El Teide, La Orotava, Icod, Garachico and Masca.&nbsp;
Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Anaga, Taganana and La Laguna
Candelaria, La Laguna, Bosque de la Esperanza and El Teide

A day you will always remember. Whether as a couple, with friends or family, this VIP tour is the most exclusive way to get to know Tenerife your way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Book now and experience Tenerife like never before.&nbsp;

Discover the grandeur of the Teide National Park, the most visited in Europe, on an exclusive tour that will take you to an altitude of 2,400 metres. Get ready to contemplate the impressive Teide, the third highest volcano in the world from its base, and explore landscapes that seem to be from another planet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

We will depart from the south of Tenerife, crossing an ever-changing landscape. We will pass through Vilaflor de Chasna, the highest municipality in the Canary Islands, where you can enjoy a barraquito, the island&#39;s most emblematic coffee.&nbsp;&nbsp;
&nbsp;&nbsp;
On the way up, you will enter the Corona Forestal Natural Park, home to the Pino Gordo, the largest of its kind in the world. As we climb, the landscape will transform into a spectacular volcanic scenery, with lava flows and the famous sea of clouds.&nbsp;&nbsp;
&nbsp;&nbsp;
Entering the caldera of the Teide National Park is like landing on Mars. We will visit iconic places such as: Los Roques de Garcia, one of the most famous postcards of the park; Las Minas de San Jose, a lunar landscape of golden sand.&nbsp; All this with incredible views of La Gomera, La Palma and El Hierro.

A natural spectacle not to be missed. This tour is a unique opportunity to discover the contrasts and volcanic beauty of Tenerife.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Book now and live an unforgettable adventure on Teide
